Sponza Atrium 3D Model

Original model: Crytek's Sponza Atrium (Frank Meinl, August 19, 2010)
Donated to the public for radiosity testing.
Corrections by Morgan McGuire (July 14, 2011).
PBR textures by Alexandre Pestana.
Converted to glTF 2.0 by Khronos Group glTF-Sample-Models project (glTF-Transform).

